1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,133
You're here, Sis

2
00:00:01,133 --> 00:00:02,800
Tell Lewes to talk to the police

3
00:00:02,833 --> 00:00:03,833
This is a family matter

4
00:00:03,833 --> 00:00:04,500
Let me go

5
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,133
Or Mom and Dad will never forgive you

6
00:00:06,833 --> 00:00:08,233
Mom and Dad can't protect you anymore

7
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,100
They drank pesticide

8
00:00:10,533 --> 00:00:12,066
They're still in the hospital

9
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:15,000
The doctor said they might not wake up

10
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:17,166
You're lying to me

11
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:21,100
That bottle was just water, no drug

12
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:22,766
It was indeed just water

13
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:24,566
But there was pesticide residue inside

14
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:25,900
They're getting old

15
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,366
Their bodies couldn't take the shock

16
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,400
They kept saying

17
00:00:29,433 --> 00:00:30,933
You've always been their favorite

18
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,500
No, please, Mom and Dad

19
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:35,533
Sis, I was wrong

20
00:00:35,533 --> 00:00:37,800
Tell the police to let me go

21
00:00:39,533 --> 00:00:40,800
You hurt Mom and Dad

22
00:00:42,233 --> 00:00:43,633
I'm not helping you anymore

23
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:45,166
Sis, Brother-in-law

24
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:46,833
I was wrong to treat you that way

25
00:00:46,833 --> 00:00:48,033
I really learned my lesson

26
00:00:48,033 --> 00:00:49,333
Please, let me go

27
00:00:49,333 --> 00:00:50,866
An apology isn't enough

28
00:00:51,133 --> 00:00:52,400
The ones who loved you unconditionally

29
00:00:52,433 --> 00:00:53,733
Are in a coma because of you

30
00:00:54,333 --> 00:00:55,566
No one's going to spoil you now

31
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:58,000
You must pay for your actions

32
00:01:05,466 --> 00:01:08,533
Defendant Daniel, for the crime of poisoning

33
00:01:08,533 --> 00:01:09,666
The facts are clear

34
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:11,033
The evidence is solid

35
00:01:11,066 --> 00:01:12,766
According to the law

36
00:01:12,933 --> 00:01:15,600
Sentenced to three years in prison

37
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:27,500
Fellow villagers

38
00:01:27,733 --> 00:01:30,033
Lewes is now the richest man in the neighboring province

39
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:31,900
But he hasn't forgotten his roots

40
00:01:32,066 --> 00:01:33,133
He provided money and technology

41
00:01:33,133 --> 00:01:34,133
To lead us all to success

42
00:01:34,133 --> 00:01:35,133
We've established a cooperative

43
00:01:35,133 --> 00:01:36,733
It officially opens today

44
00:01:36,733 --> 00:01:38,166
Let's welcome Mr. Lewes for the ribbon-cutting

45
00:01:43,533 --> 00:01:45,133
If we all work hard

46
00:01:45,466 --> 00:01:48,600
I believe our lives will get better and better
